    <string name="risk_return_question1">Q.1) How would you describe your risk taking ability?</string>
    <string name="risk_return_q1_option1">Risk averse/ Low risk taker (e.g. Fixed deposit/ Government bonds)</string>
    <string name="risk_return_q1_option2">Moderate risk taker (e.g. Mutual funds and some proportion in equity)</string>
    <string name="risk_return_q1_option3">High risk taker (e.g. equity- 90% of your portfolio in equity) </string>

    <string name="risk_return_question2">Q.2) With respect to the current interest rates, how much return do you expect to achieve from your investments?</string>
